ogress of most bills (18 of 28 filed since January 1, 2025), so their status shows as not recorded.","Each councilor's votes and office spending are not included on this site: the City Council's open data system (SAPL) does not publish individual votes or spending.","This City Council's SAPL system records no veto since January 1, 2025. Since there is no way to tell whether there was no veto or it was not recorded, the mayor's profile does not show the number of vetoes."],"conferido":"2026-10-26"}},"atualizado":"2026-10-15","onde":{"camara":{"site":"https://www.camaraaltamira.pr.gov.br/","sistema":"sapl","api":"https://sapl.riobom.pr.leg.br/api/","propostas":"https://sapl.riobom.pr.leg.br/materia/pesquisar-materia","propostasOnline":true,"sic":"https://www.camaraaltamira.pr.gov.br/esic","conferido":"2026-10-23","motivo":null,"motivo_en":null},"prefeitura":{"site":"https://www.riobom.pr.gov.br/","transparencia":null,"sic":null,"diarioOficial":null,"conferido":"2026-10-23","lido":false}}}
